hadiths[5]{hadithnumber,text}:
"744","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Nubuwwat mein se siwae naik bande ke khwab ke kuch baqi nahin raha, aur woh nubuwwat ka chhiyaliswan hissa hai.'"
"745","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jis ne mujhe khwab mein dekha to tehqeeq us ne mujhe dekha. Kyunke shaitan meri surat nahin bana sakta.' Kulaib kahta hai: Main ne yeh hadees Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) ko sunai aur main ne kaha: Beshak main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko khwab mein dekha hai. To unhon ne kaha: Kya tum Hasan bin Ali (Raziyallahu anhuma) ki shahadat yaad rakhte ho? Main ne kaha: Han, Allah ki qasam! Balke main un ki chaal bhi yaad rakhta hun. Phir unhon ne kaha: Beshak Hasan (Raziyallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se mushabeh the."
"746","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo mujh par jaan boojh kar jhoot bole to woh jahannam mein apna thikana bana le.' Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne is ka zikr farmaya to farmaya: 'Naik aadmi ka khwab nubuwwat ka chhiyaliswan hissa hai.'"
"747","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Achcha khwab Allah ki taraf se hai, jabke bura khwab shaitan ki taraf se hai. Jab tum mein se koi woh dekhe jo use napasand ho to use chahiye ke apne baen teen martaba thuke aur use zikr na kare. Kyunke woh use nuqsan nahin pahuncha sakta.'"
"748","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne parda uthaya jabke log (muazzaz sahaba Raziyallahu anhum) Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ke peeche safon mein khade the. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Nubuwwat ki khushkhabriyon mein se sirf achche/naik khwab baqi rahe hain jo Musalman dekhta hai ya jo use dikhaye jate hain.' Phir Aap ne farmaya: 'Suno! Mujhe ruku ya sajde ki haalat mein Quran padhne se mana farmaya gaya hai. Raha ruku to us mein apne Rabb ki azmat ki tasbeeh karo, aur raha sajda to us mein kasrat se dua karo. Kyunke woh tumhari duaon ke qabool hone ke ziyada laiq hai.'"
